<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Comerci raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comerci raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming Inc said on Monday it had raised its rating for Mexico's Controladora Comercial Mexicana S.A. de C.V. to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Comerci is raised to hold from buy due to the potential for margin expansion,&quot; analyst Marc de Speville said in a report.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879</p>
</text>
